        "jsCode": "const pending = $json.pendingRow;\nconst maxRetries = parseInt($node['Config'].json.MAX_RETRIES, 10);\nconst retryCount = (parseInt(pending['Retry Count'], 10) || 0) + 1;\nconst expired = $json.forceExpire === true || retryCount >= maxRetries;\nreturn [{ json: { ...$json, retryCount, expired } }];\n"
